IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `gpa-challenges`

-- Government Procurement Act 1997, ss 2, 7, 12 to 19, 24 and 26 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_government-procurement-act-1997.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

`a Singapore citizen trading alone` MEANS Supplier WITH
    `a national of Singapore or of a specified State` IS TRUE
    `formed under the laws of Singapore or of a specified State` IS FALSE
    `principal place of business in Singapore or a specified State` IS FALSE
    `specified as a relevant supplier in the order` IS FALSE
    `declared by the Minister under section 7(2)(b)` IS FALSE

`a company formed and based in a specified State` MEANS Supplier WITH
    `a national of Singapore or of a specified State` IS FALSE
    `formed under the laws of Singapore or of a specified State` IS TRUE
    `principal place of business in Singapore or a specified State` IS TRUE
    `specified as a relevant supplier in the order` IS FALSE
    `declared by the Minister under section 7(2)(b)` IS FALSE

`a Singapore company based in an unlisted country` MEANS Supplier WITH
    `a national of Singapore or of a specified State` IS FALSE
    `formed under the laws of Singapore or of a specified State` IS TRUE
    `principal place of business in Singapore or a specified State` IS FALSE
    `specified as a relevant supplier in the order` IS FALSE
    `declared by the Minister under section 7(2)(b)` IS FALSE

`an unlisted-country company based in Singapore` MEANS Supplier WITH
    `a national of Singapore or of a specified State` IS FALSE
    `formed under the laws of Singapore or of a specified State` IS FALSE
    `principal place of business in Singapore or a specified State` IS TRUE
    `specified as a relevant supplier in the order` IS FALSE
    `declared by the Minister under section 7(2)(b)` IS FALSE

`a foreign company named in the order` MEANS Supplier WITH
    `a national of Singapore or of a specified State` IS FALSE
    `formed under the laws of Singapore or of a specified State` IS FALSE
    `principal place of business in Singapore or a specified State` IS FALSE
    `specified as a relevant supplier in the order` IS TRUE
    `declared by the Minister under section 7(2)(b)` IS FALSE

`a foreign company declared by the Minister` MEANS Supplier WITH
    `a national of Singapore or of a specified State` IS FALSE
    `formed under the laws of Singapore or of a specified State` IS FALSE
    `principal place of business in Singapore or a specified State` IS FALSE
    `specified as a relevant supplier in the order` IS FALSE
    `declared by the Minister under section 7(2)(b)` IS TRUE

`a national of an unlisted country` MEANS Supplier WITH
    `a national of Singapore or of a specified State` IS FALSE
    `formed under the laws of Singapore or of a specified State` IS FALSE
    `principal place of business in Singapore or a specified State` IS FALSE
    `specified as a relevant supplier in the order` IS FALSE
    `declared by the Minister under section 7(2)(b)` IS FALSE

